  title: "Nh\xE0 s\xE0n tr\xEAn tr\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3ng"
  body: "Hoa v\u0103n tr\u1ED1ng Ng\u1ECDc L\u0169 c\xF3 c\u1EA3nh nh\xE0 s\xE0n
    v\u1EDBi m\xE1i u\u1ED1n cong. H\xECnh nh\xE0 c\xF9ng c\xE1c sinh ho\u1EA1t quanh
    n\xF3 l\xE0 t\u01B0 li\u1EC7u \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm hi\u1EC3u c\u01B0 d\xE2n \u0110\xF4ng
    S\u01A1n. Nh\xE0 s\xE0n \u0111\xE1 treo trong m\xE0n ch\u01A1i l\xE0 thi\u1EBFt
    k\u1EBF h\u01B0 c\u1EA5u."
